5,1,1,talk,May,,Hello everyone! Let's get this sorted. I want to make sure we're being fair about where this point actually sits. I'll look into the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree that fairness is key. To understand how different arrangements actually affect our daily lives, I'll look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the visit to the station block's bin house.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to make sure we know how much this is going to cost us! I'll check the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,I hope we can find a solution that keeps us all on good terms. I'll look into the station block's meeting minutes and the statements at the residents' meeting to see how others handled this.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to seek a balance between fairness and harmony. To understand the true burden of maintenance, I shall look into the ward filing requirements and the truck arrival time from the crew leader.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"Since we've all picked our topics, I'm curious if anyone else thinks we should double-check the costs? @Kenji, do you think the ledger will be enough, or should we look at the subsidy again?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, I believe Kenji has the costs covered. We should focus on the practicalities of the daily routine to ensure the solution is sustainable for everyone.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@May, I think the ledger and subsidy info should give us a clear picture of the money side. I'll let you know exactly what I find out!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Mizuki. While the budget is important, the way we treat each other during this process is what will truly matter in the long run. I hope my research helps us avoid old conflicts.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, and a thorough investigation now prevents resentment later. I believe our current distribution of research is comprehensive. Let us see what the facts reveal before we rush to judgment.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I'm satisfied with our plan then. I'll stick with my choices. I really want to see if the complaints are coming from just one person or if we're all feeling the same way.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"That is a valid point, @May. Understanding the source of the friction will help us avoid a solution that only solves one person's problem while creating new ones for the rest of us.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm just excited to see the numbers! If we find a way to save money or get a subsidy, maybe we can all feel better about the whole thing. I'll do my best to find everything!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm glad we're all so motivated. I just hope that by looking at how other blocks managed their disagreements, we can find a way to move forward with kindness and mutual respect.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, the spirit in which we approach this is as important as the result. Let us proceed with an open mind and a willingness to listen to one another's findings.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,I'm ready to get started. Let's hope the data gives us a clear path forward so we can settle this quickly and fairly for everyone. I'll see you all after the research!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I am ready as well. I look forward to seeing how the practical realities of the other lanes compare to our situation. See you all soon.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too! I'm going to go find those numbers right now. I'll make sure to be super careful with the math so we have the right info. See you guys later!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll be waiting for everyone to return. I hope we can all share what we've learned in a way that brings us closer together. See you all soon!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"May we all return with clarity and a spirit of cooperation. I shall seek the truth in the details. Until we meet again, my friends.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
